00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.150
They help you expose
tools, and services,

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:01.050
and workflows through
messaging interface.

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:04.560
Think of them as users that
live inside your messaging

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.200
app, but being
powered by software

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.270
rather than being
powered by humans.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:12.120
So in the next few
minutes, I'm going

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.450
